                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/12/ukraine-receives-new-dutch-minehunter-another-to-follow-before-the-year-ends/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="ukraine-receives-new-dutch-minehunter-another-to-follow-before-the-year-ends">Ukraine receives new Dutch minehunter — another to follow before the year ends</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
